    "_string": "- All new and existing punters are eligible to join the promotions and take the chance to win bigger prizes. \n- The winning amount is paid according to the promotion rules and payouts. \n- The Promotion is applied for a certain period ruled by the Company. When the promotion expires, the betting odds will be set back to the previous values.\n- The Company reserves the right to vary any of the terms of entry applying to this promotion or to modify, terminate, suspend, or reschedule this promotion at any time.\n- Any dispute arising from or in the connection with this promotion shall be decided by the Company.",
